# Play test of The Drowned Metropolis (CIPlay drowned_metropolis, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe:
# the ferry islet west, the Harbour Tower south-west (roof 12-21 m), the sunken offices and the Spire's foundations in
# the middle, the Meridian Tower east (pool deck 6-9 m).
island The Drowned Metropolis
expect step 0
expect title The Keys of Meridian

# The ferry islet: the evacuation notice
walk -52 -41 to -44 -34 h=4
zone ferry
expect step 1
read Evacuation notice
expect step 2

# Up the Harbour Tower's ladders, up its roof to the mayor's penthouse
climb -19.2 -50 h=0.3
climb -19.2 -50 h=6.5
expect stand -22 -50 h=12.4
zone harbourroof
expect step 3
walk -22 -50 to -35 -50 to -45 -50 to -55 -50 h=21.2
read Mayor's memo
open Penthouse safe
expect story keycard 1

# Down to the sunken council offices: puffer fish, the filing cabinet
zone offices
expect message puffs up
kill Puffer fish
open Council filing cabinet
expect story keycard 2

# The Spire's foundations: the Lantern Lord, the treasurer's strongbox
zone foundations
expect message a light swings
kill Angler fish
open Foundation strongbox
expect story keycard 3
expect step 5

# Up the Meridian Tower to the pool deck: the vault
climb 45.7 -2 h=-3
climb 45.7 -2 h=3
expect stand 48 -2 h=8.8
zone meridianroof
expect step 6
open Meridian Vault
expect story keycard 0
expect item Blueprint_BatteryAdvanced 1
expect done
